    "create_time": 1761615878.708,
    "update_time": null,
    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "Check with the instructor first, since it's their rubric. If they agree, share it before the next assignment rather than retroactively for P3. Changing the visible criteria after submission invites regrade requests. For P3, use it internally and put a short note in feedback, e.g., \"Framework named but not applied to the stakeholders you identified (12/20).\""
     ]
    },
